 is the original premise where applicable, not a newly minted approval flag. Source work establishes the dispatch and argument relation; genuine instance evidence establishes the actual subject and applicable context. The provider premise supplies only the declared semantics.

A kernel correctly returning foreign proc data or received-FD contents does not close those payloads’ origins. Likewise, the inode-zero exclusion does not authenticate arbitrary anonymous code.

Minimum evidence for the reported categories
Category	Sufficient scoped boundary and remaining evidence
RSEQ	Resolve the exact selected UAPI declaration, meaning of end, alignment, and the producer’s arithmetic before claiming numerical size/alignment relations. Do not substitute sizeof for active extent. get_count_order, CLOCKS_PER_SEC/`USER_HZ`, and native ELF aliases are definitional questions, not reasons to audit the whole kernel. Later writes to registered RSEQ memory require a separate owned-registration/update contract.
Random seed	Establish the sixteen-byte request, genuine provider dispatch, copy length, fresh exec-stack destination, and AT_RANDOM pointer relationship. The origin proof can stop at the kernel RNG. Entropy contributors and ChaCha internals need not be recursively verified for this claim.
Signal-frame requirement	Bind the actual native ABI’s AT_MINSIGSTKSZ to its genuine provider. Preserve the reported unconditional emission and configured IA32/FPU effects. No guessed constant or silently simplified native-only formula is permissible. Proving every FPU calculation is unnecessary unless reproducing the numerical result is itself required.
vDSO/vvar	Preserve the reported vdso64_enabled guard without inventing a null test. Account separately for kernel-provided executable code, dynamic data, selected ABI, and actual mapping. The existing OS boundary covers genuine kernel implementation integrity; a pointer-range check or source tag does not establish actual mapping correspondence or all subsequent observations.
CPU and execution state	Give HWCAP fields their selected ABI meanings and bind credentials, secure-exec state, and any executable FD to the actual exec. Prove an FD branch absent or establish its ownership. Direct CPU instructions and arbitrary hypervisor leaves are not automatically covered by an auxv contract.

Selecting this particular kernel/configuration remains an instance-admission matter. The source association is not a reproducible-build or running-memory proof, but neither does the original contract require inventing such a proof merely to use its declared OS premise.

